Epic: bd-01KXYJK0XSA3RNH9ANMVC96EPE

Delete modules/linalg and modules/linalg-breeze only after dense, sparse and operator, factorization, spectral, and related-duplicate migrations are complete.

Remove their build projects, dependency edges, aggregates, aliases, README blurbs, and the obsolete strategy that declares Scalafim linalg the canonical backend owner. Update vision and module-relations documentation to the final Gale boundary.

Closure gates
- rg finds no production scalafim.linalg import or private generic eigensolver, SVD, inverse, QR, or matrix helper family without an explicit domain justification;
- no Breeze dependency remains in Scalafim shared or production modules;
- compileAll and testAll pass on JVM and Scala.js with warnings enabled;
- fit, multivar, connectivity, graph, image, HRF, and serialization parity fixtures pass;
- spectral residual and ordering suites, allocation checks, and performance guardrails pass;
- git diff --check passes and the exact Gale dependency is reproducible from a clean checkout;
- migration shims and compatibility aliases are gone.

Close the epic only with these results recorded as a completion note.
